877
00:48:25,430 --> 00:48:26,430
Yes.

878
00:48:28,520 --> 00:48:29,780
Take a seat.

879
00:48:30,350 --> 00:48:31,430
Have a seat.

880
00:48:33,300 --> 00:48:34,240
Mm...

881
00:48:36,130 --> 00:48:36,760
Jam.

882
